      'Reviewed Goat Funded Trader official platform FAQ on 2026-10-01. It lists five firm-level platforms and U.S. restrictions for MT5/cTrader, but does not publish the offer-level platform mapping for Goat Blitz.'),
    ('goat-funded-trader','instant-pro','Goat Funded Trader Instant Pro platform scope','https://help.goatfundedtrader.com/en/articles/10741900-which-platforms-can-i-trade-on','Goat Funded Trader platform availability — 2026-10-01',
